  "comment": "Cara membuat LiveUSB Backtrack Masukan USB drive (minimal 2Gbyte) Format USB drive ke FAT32 (misalnya USB drive di /dev/sdb1) # mkfs.vfat /dev/sdb1 Install UNetbootin Jalankan UNetbootin gunakan backtrack-finel ISO. Pilih USB drive &amp; klik \"OK\" Masuk ke BackTrack dengan default username &amp; password root / toor. Referensi http://www.backtrack-linux.org/tutorials/usb-live-install/",
